WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Unity flight dynamics coupled to a Simulink fuel-cell-battery powertrain.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Simulated fuel-cell power, battery power, state of charge and DC-bus voltage.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Climb response shown by altitude, velocity and propulsion telemetry.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Software co-simulation of the recorded climb scenario.
